ched hereto and\nmade a part hereof.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"68 FR 1133 (PDF p. 1); Sec. 4","sha256":"9c243b83af19bdb4b1f0a735e3cea41b6e4e956364e8d6aea56c03a1936d32c6","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2003-01-08/pdf/03-464.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13282#sec4","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) Pursuant to sections 5304 and 5304a of title 5, United States Code,\nlocality-based comparability payments shall be paid in accordance with\nSchedule 9 attached hereto and made a part hereof.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"68 FR 1133 (PDF p. 1); Sec. 5(a)","sha256":"9c243b83af19bdb4b1f0a735e3cea41b6e4e956364e8d6aea56c03a1936d32c6","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2003-01-08/pdf/03-464.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13282#sec5(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) The Director of the Office of Personnel Management shall take such\nactions as may be necessary to implement these payments and to publish\nappropriate notice of such payments in the Federal Register.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"68 FR 1133 (PDF p. 1); Sec. 5(b)","sha256":"9c243b83af19bdb4b1f0a735e3cea41b6e4e956364e8d6aea56c03a1936d32c6","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2003-01-08/pdf/03-464.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13282#sec5(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 6. Administrative Law Judges. The rates of basic pay for administrative\nlaw judges, as adjusted under 5 U.S.C. 5372(b)(4), are set forth on Schedule\n10 attached hereto and made a part hereof.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"68 FR 1133 (PDF p. 1); Sec. 6","sha256":"9c243b83af19bdb4b1f0a735e3cea41b6e4e956364e8d6aea56c03a1936d32c6","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2003-01-08/pdf/03-464.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13282#sec6","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predi